flowchart LR
  S[Specs / vendor docs / repos / community] --> W[Source watcher or contributor]
  W --> P[Proposal]
  P --> V[Schema + referential validation]
  V --> R[Human review]
  R --> E[Immutable evidence]
  E --> A[Assertion]
  A --> D[Derived profile resolver]
  D --> UI[Feature & harness pages]
  T[Isolated conformance runner] --> E
